UID:dd6f8778-eb1f-11f1-8000-70a8a527d0f0
DTSTART:20261128
DTEND:20261130
SUMMARY:Part Closure: ELIZABETH LINE: Saturday 28 and Sunday 29 November\, 
 no service between Maidenhead / Heathrow (all terminals) and Abbey Wood / 
 Shenfield. Use PICCADILLY LINE services between Heathrow and Central 
 London. LONDON PADDINGTON STATION will be closed on this day\, with no 
 HEATHROW EXPRESS services. GWR services will not run between Maidenhead / 
 Greenford and Paddington\, with limited long distance services to/from 
 Euston. There will also be no GREATER ANGLIA services on these days 
 between Shenfield / Southend Victoria / Southminster and Liverpool 
 Street\, use CENTRAL LINE connections between Ealing Broadway\, West Acton
  (for Acton Main Line)\, Central London\, Liverpool Street\, Stratford and
  Newbury Park. Replacement bus services operate\, not serving Iver\, 
 please use Langley instead.
END:VEVENT
